/*
  NotificationGroupRow.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0190 · NotificationGroupRow (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `NotificationGroupRow` resolves (table "NotificationGroupRow") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the EXACT keys extracted from the web source
  (features/notifications/components/NotificationGroupRow.tsx). The web `{{count}}`
  interpolation is expressed natively as a positional `%lld` so
  String.localizedStringWithFormat applies locale-correct number formatting. The
  remainder backs the native state envelope (load/empty/error chrome, freshness
  chip + connectivity banner), the severity labels, and the VoiceOver summaries.
*/

